08:06.641 --> 08:10.076
Increase x by one, you're
gonna decrease y by one.

08:10.076 --> 08:13.874
If you increase x by two,
you're gonna decrease y by two.

08:13.874 --> 08:16.438
And so our line is gonna
look something like this.

08:16.438 --> 08:19.433
