08:30.891 --> 08:32.819
you get the point.

08:32.819 --> 08:34.409
It's gonna look something like that.

08:34.409 --> 08:36.208
So from slope-intercept form,

08:36.208 --> 08:38.740
very easy to figure out
what the y-intercept is,

08:38.740 --> 08:41.038
